== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: bndstx [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0x1B]
     LENGTH:  3
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: MPX
    ISA-SET: MPX
    ISA-EXT: MPX
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 0F 1B 00 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT    NONE      MODRM_RM    192      3      64      UINT  TYPE  =                 MIB
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R     MODRM_REG    128      1     128       INT                         bnd0
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: bndstx %bnd0, (%rax)
   RELATIVE: bndstx %bnd0, (%rax)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: bndstx ds:[rax], bnd0
   RELATIVE: bndstx ds:[rax], bnd0

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
0F 1B 00 
:     :..MODRM
:..OPCODE
